      "field": "inscriptions[0].inscription_translation",
      "text": "Inscription:\na) Inner band:\nb) Outer band:  \n\"During this Xin dynasty, good copper is being mined at Danyang.\nMixed with silver and tin, the alloy is clear and bright. \nThe dragon at left and tiger at right: \nThey govern the four directions. \nYour eight sons [and nine grandsons will take the center].",
      "source_text": "新有善銅出丹陽，\n和以銀錫青且明。\n左龍右虎主四澎（旁）\n八子。",
      "remark": ""
    }
  ],
